Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.95,0:00:18.62,Default,,0,0,0,,So, your promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me about my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She was in my class.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.58,0:00:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,At the same school where\Nyour teacher committed suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,No, a different one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.79,0:00:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,After that happened,\NI was transferred to another school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.20,0:00:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That was where I met Elena.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.50,0:00:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She was such a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:01:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Transferring schools and my teacher's suicide\Nmade me distance myself from others,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.83,0:01:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but she seemed determined\Nto strike up a conversation with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.16,0:01:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,She helped me feel less alone,\Neven just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.41,0:01:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I felt like I could really trust her.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.83,0:01:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I might have\Nhad some ulterior motives...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.54,0:01:23.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't need to know that...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.25,0:01:27.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I find it difficult\Nto believe what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Would Elena really kill her parents\Nand murder countless others?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Lame. Only 2,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.41,0:03:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think the person that\Ndropped this was looking for coins?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.08,0:03:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Get rid of it. Don't get distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.29,0:03:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,We're after bigger prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.12,0:03:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.50,0:03:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you giving me orders? I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.25,0:03:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Subaru.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.33,0:03:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm tired. I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.41,0:03:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get upset with him. He's still a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.62,0:03:54.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:04:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't be able to complete\Nour goals without his help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Not here. Let's keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.20,0:04:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.29,0:04:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.08,0:04:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You said there were dangerous people\Nin these mountains, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.62,0:04:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever run into one of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.45,0:04:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.50,0:04:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,So you have! What should we do\Nif we see one?! Please tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.45,0:04:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To tell the truth, I haven't--
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:37.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.08,0:04:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.62,0:04:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,On the day I first went to Clair's apartment,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.91,0:04:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,some woman attacked us out of nowhere...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We fought, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.62,0:04:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.16,0:05:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You... You wouldn't kill another person...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.66,0:05:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it! She did it, didn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.54,0:05:09.75,Default,,0,0,0,,While she was inside you, like I am now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.75,0:05:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I'm the one that killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't stop Clair.\NAnd I knew what she was going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.29,0:05:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.83,0:05:30.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That smell...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.16,0:05:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not alone. There are two... Three!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.54,0:05:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it!\NAre these Clair's sister's friends?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell by the smell alone--
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They are on a completely different level!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.75,0:05:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Their power... There's no way\Nwe could match them!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.25,0:05:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My wallet's scent is coming from them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.62,0:06:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What should we do? My ID is in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.41,0:06:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What if they come to my house?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.58,0:06:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shuichi... They're not bad people, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.16,0:06:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,This strength... They're her allies.\NIf we make one wrong move...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.29,0:06:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, do you think I should\Ntell my parents to run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I overthinking it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.25,0:06:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.75,0:06:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't do that! What if they find us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.79,0:06:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. I will save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.54,0:06:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, we had a lot to talk about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.75,0:07:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But the pact is complete.\NThis girl... Clair is now one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.66,0:07:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Glad to be a part of the team!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.00,0:07:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You finished the pact!\NSo we can talk to her now, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Yota Murakami.\NI'm 19, no real job yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.54,0:07:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm into music, and I'm looking for a girlfr--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.04,0:07:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, where is Shuichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.04,0:07:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Your friend ran off somewhere\Nwith Yoshioka--the girl with the helmet--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.54,0:07:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,and they haven't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:25.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? Do they know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.29,0:07:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My bad, I should have stopped them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They said they'd be back soon,\Nthat they were going on a walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.37,0:07:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,--That stupid girl. Who cares about her? She's--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,--Hey, you.\N--That stupid girl. Who cares about her? She's--
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.70,0:07:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know where Shuichi went?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.83,0:07:54.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's crazy, you can record video.\NYou're like a real camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.95,0:07:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Convenient for a voyeur, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:08:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up! I'm just into making movies!\NI followed them because--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.50,0:08:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why you did.\NI just want to know where Shuichi is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.04,0:08:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.37,0:08:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where I stopped recording.\NI lost them after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.83,0:08:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.91,0:08:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Please excuse me,\NI'm going to go look for Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.16,0:08:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.83,0:08:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They're not back, and we haven't\Nheard from them for over an hour--
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.83,0:08:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a good chance\Nthey're in some kind of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.66,0:08:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you realize that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.08,0:08:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care. It's not like\NI'm going to bother you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.20,0:08:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were a bit more well behaved...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.75,0:08:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Although I like that you\Nwon't abandon your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's give her an escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.25,0:09:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that we have a lot of\Nnatural fighters in our group.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.00,0:09:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There is one though. Yota, do you mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.16,0:09:08.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.04,0:09:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.41,0:09:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not just some ugly dude\Nthat turns handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you calling ugly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.58,0:09:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, she said--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.41,0:09:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you. We don't talk about our allies'\Nsecrets to anyone who isn't an ally.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.41,0:09:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyhow, I'll leave it to you two.\NThis is our problem, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.95,0:09:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka is one of us.\NAnd of course, you are too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.16,0:09:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the same then.\NMy weakness caused her death.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.95,0:09:43.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so scared.\NOnly worried about saving myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.41,0:09:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,But I won't run away anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.79,0:09:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who I have to face!\NNo matter what happens!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.25,0:09:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The scents have split.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:10:00.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The one with the wallet is alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:02.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This might work out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.79,0:10:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What might?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want something?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.12,0:10:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,A kid?! When did he--?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.04,0:10:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. You called me a kid, huh?\NYou trying to make fun of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.58,0:10:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... I'm looking for my wallet...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.83,0:10:22.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You piss me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.75,0:10:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Little shits...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.79,0:10:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter who I have to face.\NNo matter what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.20,0:10:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I promised... I'd save you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.45,0:11:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Mother. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.41,0:11:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Squashed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.50,0:11:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you want to go out with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.20,0:11:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.66,0:11:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're totally my type, Clairy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.79,0:11:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't call me that, creep. Fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.33,0:11:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that really your actual face?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.50,0:11:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you hide your face\Nwhen you first met us?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.25,0:11:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have any reason to hide it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.04,0:11:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have family or anyone else\Nthat I need to keep secrets from.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.20,0:11:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You seemed a bit timid when I first saw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.45,0:11:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the only one in\Nthe group that can fight, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.08,0:12:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,If something were to happen,\Nwould I be able to protect them by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.33,0:12:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.58,0:12:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I don't look impressive,\Nbut I'm pretty strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I still don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.20,0:12:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,There are crazy monsters in these mountains,\Nthings you can't even imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.29,0:12:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't have the same\Nfearsome scent that they did.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.00,0:12:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Scent, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.62,0:12:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, so why did you join\Na team of weaklings like us?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.29,0:12:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone would have been fine.\NYou happened to be the first ones I met.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wanted information.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.41,0:12:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I also thought it'd be easy\Nto use a bunch of clowns like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.62,0:12:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's what I'm talking about!\NYou're so cool, totally my type!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.37,0:12:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up. Fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.95,0:12:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so is that costume guy your boyfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.16,0:12:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.08,0:13:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.50,0:13:05.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more than that. He's my other half.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.83,0:13:14.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi and I. We two are one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.75,0:13:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Shuichi. I'll be there soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.87,0:13:28.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Little shits. Not even worth my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.75,0:13:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Shuichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.37,0:13:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the form you take means something.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.58,0:13:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's frustrating.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.04,0:13:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are we so weak?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.91,0:14:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It frustrates you, too... Doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What an incredible idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Letting someone inside of you\Nto make up for your own weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.16,0:14:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.66,0:14:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worried about Subaru.\NI'm going to go check on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.00,0:14:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt there's anyone around\Nhere that could harm him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.04,0:14:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. Still... He's only a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.37,0:15:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that scream?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.00,0:15:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously? How cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:11.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A metamorphosis, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.83,0:15:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still shit to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.33,0:15:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.54,0:15:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I was bored anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.25,0:15:22.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's have some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.20,0:15:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh. Are you a rare, like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.95,0:15:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Still.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.50,0:15:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet I'm rarer than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.95,0:15:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The rage... It's welling up...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.79,0:16:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been so angry about\Nsomething that was done to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.87,0:16:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.08,0:16:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I Shuichi Kagaya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.41,0:16:33.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I Chihiro Yoshioka?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.12,0:16:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,No. I am neither.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.87,0:16:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know everything about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.62,0:16:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything she's ever done.\NWhat kind of person she was.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is why...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,...he must pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.62,0:16:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,He crushed her and threw her away,\Nlike a worthless piece of trash...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:17.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And that is my rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka feels it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He treated me like trash. And now we rage!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.33,0:17:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.37,0:17:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The rage will burn!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.75,0:17:52.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to kill this boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.16,0:17:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.75,0:18:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What...?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay out of this, Elena! He's--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.87,0:18:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Subaru. You have an important part to play.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.16,0:18:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want you to use that power here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.54,0:18:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.50,0:18:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.04,0:18:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She's the enemy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.41,0:18:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,She tried to kill Clair and I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.70,0:18:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,And she turned me into a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.25,0:18:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I must stop her!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.87,0:18:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I know this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.79,0:19:00.33,Default,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.62,0:19:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this... Shuichi's memory?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.58,0:19:18.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stop her...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.87,0:19:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to stop this vile woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.75,0:19:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why...?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.54,0:19:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.16,0:20:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, I'm fine. Please don't be frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.45,0:20:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.16,0:20:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who found this coin, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.75,0:20:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,There's someone I want to be with!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.33,0:20:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, are you talking about... him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.58,0:20:16.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.79,0:20:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But even if I could be with him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.62,0:20:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never... Not again... Not him...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,So, this is the path you have chosen, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.62,0:20:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,A dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.25,0:20:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the first I've ever had.\NIs it because of this body?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.66,0:20:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder just how long it's been.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.66,0:20:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The seasons come and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.62,0:21:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Time goes ticking by,\Nand the world keeps changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's truly fascinating. I feel like\NI must watch where this all leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.20,0:21:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know those guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.25,0:21:14.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.95,0:21:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Not that I care. But you\Nbetter not get in my way again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.41,0:21:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If you do... Nothing will stop me, not even you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.33,0:21:29.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. You're welcome to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.83,0:21:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if I'm killed...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.66,0:21:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,...I won't be allowed to die\Nuntil this is all over. It won't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.45,0:21:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was out of line.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.66,0:21:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:57.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.83,0:22:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop! We still don't know\Nif there are enemies out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.45,0:22:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Shuichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.41,0:23:46.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}"Episode 8: Shadows in Memory"
